     "text": "On 803 operator-reported manoeuvre events of 15 satellites, evaluated leave-one-satellite-out, the classifier reaches F1 0.81 (precision 0.83, recall 0.80), the physics baseline 0.74 and CUSUM 0.52. A detector using only the step in semi-major axis reaches 0.79.",
